e checklist.\n- Explicitly keeps full frontend UI integration, Supabase writes, RAG reindexing, and vector mutations out of scope for this AO chain.\n\nCloses #1414\n\n## Verification\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (required first command; pass with branch naming warning)\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-frontend-integration-handoff.test.js` (red first: missing builder module, then pass)\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-question-runtime-payload-frontend-integration-handoff.mjs` (validator_status: pass)\n- `git diff --cached --check` (pass)\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-frontend-integration-handoff.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-frontend-fixtures.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-read-model-rehearsal.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-rag-lite-read-path.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/question-runtime-payload-artifact-adapter.test.js` (5 suites, 30 tests pass)\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (post-commit pass with expected `feat/*` branch warning and ahead-of-origin warning before push)\n","created_at":"2026-07-07T08:54:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T09:58:00Z","closed_at":"2026-07-07T09:58:00Z","merged_at":"2026-07-07T09:57:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"fa8cce9d67d7ee0ca915a5ab9e1c91c65a956cbe","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1425/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1425/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1425/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos